---
description: Enforce the ONSEKI evidence-gated Agent Loop contract
globs:
alwaysApply: true
---

- Before changing product code, read @AGENT_LOOP_CONTRACT.md, @loop/state.json and @loop/policy.json.
- Work on at most one READY Gap.
- Do not change a Gap's acceptance criteria to fit an implementation.
- Implementers cannot mark their own work VERIFIED.
- Missing or conflicting evidence means INCONCLUSIVE, not PASS.
- Product direction, production deployment, secrets and destructive changes require human approval.
- Never run unattended work on main or master.
- Never deploy from the unattended loop.
- Stop when no new evidence is produced.
